<title>USA: Echlin sees modest unit sales growth.</title>
<headline>Echlin sees modest unit sales growth.</headline>
<dateline>BRANFORD, Conn. 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Echlin Inc said Friday it expects modest unit sales growth for the rest of the fiscal year.</p>
<p>Echlin, a manufacturer of motor vehicle parts, today reported flat second quarter net income of $0.38 per share. Net sales for the period, ended February 28, were $842 million, up from $736 million a year earlier.</p>
</text>
